{"content":[{"c":["SHAPHAT"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Simeonite, Hori’s son and one of the 12 spies sent by Moses to search out the land of Canaan (",{"href":"?bref=Num.13.5","r":"Num.13.5","rawR":"Num.13.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.13.5","value":"Num.13.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 13:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Father of the prophet Elisha from the town of Abel-meholah (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.19.16,19","r":"1Kgs.19.16,19","rawR":"1Kgs.19.16,19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.19.16,19","value":"1Kgs.19.16,19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 19:16, 19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.3.11","r":"2Kgs.3.11","rawR":"2Kgs.3.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.3.11","value":"2Kgs.3.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 3:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.6.31","r":"2Kgs.6.31","rawR":"2Kgs.6.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.6.31","value":"2Kgs.6.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"6:31"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Youngest of Shemaiah’s six sons from Judah’s tribe and a descendant of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.22","r":"1Chr.3.22","rawR":"1Chr.3.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.22","value":"1Chr.3.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Gadite chief in Bashan, a region west of the Jordan River (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.12","r":"1Chr.5.12","rawR":"1Chr.5.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.12","value":"1Chr.5.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Adlai’s son and a member of King David’s staff. Shaphat had charge of David’s cattle in the valleys (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.29","r":"1Chr.27.29","rawR":"1Chr.27.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.29","value":"1Chr.27.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Shaphat","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 13:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstrea